{"source":"/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      UI Variables                                    +\nproject    nord-atom-ui                                    +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord-atom-ui +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                               +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com                 +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                              +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[Index]\n  > Animations\n  > Base\n      Background\n      Text\n  > Components\n      Button\n      Gutter\n      Input\n      Overlay\n      Pane\n      Panel\n      Progress Indicator\n      Scrollbar\n      Site\n      Tab\n      Tooltip\n      Tree View\n  > Configurations\n  > Fonts\n  > Package Support\n      build\n      imdone-atom\n      markdown-preview\n  > Sizes\n      Base\n      Font\n      Input\n      Tab\n*/\n/*+---------+\n  + Imports +\n  +---------+*/\n/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      Nord                                    +\nproject    nord                                    +\nversion    0.1.0                                   +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                       +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com         +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                      +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[References]\nKSS\n  (http://warpspire.com/kss)\nkss-node\n  (https://github.com/kss-node/kss-node)\n*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Animations +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+------+\n  + Base +\n  +------+*/\n/*+--- Background ---+*/\n/*+--- Text ---+*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Components +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+--- Button ---+*/\n/*+--- Gutter ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- Overlay ---+*/\n/*+--- Pane ---+*/\n/*+--- Panel ---+*/\n/*+--- Progress Indicator ---+*/\n/*+--- Scrollbar ---+*/\n/*+--- Site ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n/*+--- Tooltip ---+*/\n/*+--- Tree View ---+*/\n/*+----------------+\n  + Configurations +\n  +----------------+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Fonts +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+-----------------+\n  + Package Support +\n  +-----------------+*/\n/*+--- build ---+*/\n/*+--- imdone-atom ---+*/\n/*+--- indent-guide-improved ---+*/\n/*+--- markdown-preview ---+*/\n/*+--- tool-bar ---+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Sizes +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+--- Base ---+*/\n/*+--- Font ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- List ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight.highlight-selected .region {\n  position: absolute;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: -1;\n}\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight-selected .region {\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  background-color: transparent;\n  border-width: 1px;\n  border-style: solid;\n}\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight-selected .region {\n  border-color: #ddd;\n}\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight-selected.background .region {\n  background-color: rgba(155, 149, 0, 0.6);\n}\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight-selected.light-theme .region {\n  border-color: rgba(255, 128, 64, 0.4);\n}\natom-text-editor .highlights .highlight-selected.light-theme.background .region {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 128, 64, 0.2);\n}\nstatus-bar .highlight-selected-status {\n  display: inline-block;\n}\nstatus-bar .highlight-selected-hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n"}